      "id": "t31_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -284
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Vec2 math (no splitting)\n\n`vec2/*` nodes operate on vec2 as one unit. Add, Scale, Length, Normalize all take vec2 inputs and produce vec2 outputs — much cleaner than splitting and recombining.\n\nScale a base vec2 (150, 0) by sin(time) and draw an ellipse there: vec2 in, vec2 out, no split.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 220
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Vec2 math (no splitting)\n\n`vec2/*` nodes operate on vec2 as one unit. Add, Scale, Length, Normalize all take vec2 inputs and produce vec2 outputs — much cleaner than splitting and recombining.\n\nScale a base vec2 (150, 0) by sin(time) and draw an ellipse there: vec2 in, vec2 out, no split.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 220
      }
